{"id":"SK-019","uuid":"35c3b9f7-653b-573c-9c6f-7579f4ee6c37","oracleId":"3706fad5-53c4-5907-9bfe-f3c8dd9e859d","localId":"019","category":"Trainer","name":{"zh-tw":"等級球","ja":"レベルボール"},"illustrator":"Ryo Ueda","regulationMark":"E","trainerType":"Item","effect":{"zh-tw":"從自己的牌庫選擇1張HP為「90」以下的寶可夢卡，在給對手看過後加入手牌。並且重洗牌庫。","ja":"自分の山札から、HPが「90」以下のポケモンを1枚選び、相手に見せて、手札に加える。そして山札を切る。"},"legal":{"standard":false,"expanded":false},"imageLanguages":["zh-tw"],"versions":[{"finishes":null,"printings":{"zh-tw":{"uuid":"3a6e091a-969b-58d2-a1d0-c4dfb46bd746"}}}]},
{"id":"SK-020","uuid":"f696fca8-bd6e-5eeb-9e39-298186aa86ee","oracleId":"f9926a30-21ef-5501-99f7-fb62b37ef86c","localId":"020","category":"Trainer","name":{"zh-tw":"大護符","ja":"大きなおまもり"},"illustrator":"inose yukie","regulationMark":"D","trainerType":"Tool","effect":{"zh-tw":"寶可夢道具卡，附於自己的寶可夢使用。1隻寶可夢只可附上1張寶可夢道具卡，並且保持附加狀態。","ja":"ポケモンのどうぐは、自分のポケモンにつけて使う。ポケモン1匹につき1枚だけつけられ、つけたままにする。"},"legal":{"standard":false,"expanded":false},"imageLanguages":["zh-tw"],"versions":[{"finishes":null,"printings":{"zh-tw":{"uuid":"62b58f63-3355-576e-92dd-f8eb41bcd9ba"}}}]},
{"id":"SK-021","uuid":"18cd62aa-8a20-598f-bbcd-7db78f807d3e","oracleId":"1abc8fdc-ec6e-5b85-ad49-263da65f544e","localId":"021","category":"Trainer","name":{"zh-tw":"氣球","ja":"ふうせん"},"illustrator":"Yoshinobu Saito","regulationMark":"D","trainerType":"Tool","effect":{"zh-tw":"寶可夢道具卡，附於自己的寶可夢使用。1隻寶可夢只可附上1張寶可夢道具卡，並且保持附加狀態。","ja":"ポケモンのどうぐは、自分のポケモンにつけて使う。ポケモン1匹につき1枚だけつけられ、つけたままにする。"},"legal":{"standard":false,"expanded":false},"versions":[{"finishes":null,"printings":{"zh-tw":{"uuid":"70348446-8790-5a0a-8d55-acda45b4ec5d"}}}]},
{"id":"SK-022","uuid":"841afe96-f418-539d-bb55-0e4bb2d7cf94","oracleId":"ad4856de-9440-554e-803f-bcc707d41597","localId":"022","category":"Trainer","name":{"zh-tw":"奇巴納","ja":"キバナ"},"illustrator":"take","regulationMark":"E","trainerType":"Supporter","effect":{"zh-tw":"這張卡必須在上個對手的回合自己的寶可夢【氣絕】了才可使用。 從自己的棄牌區選擇1張基本能量卡，附於自己的寶可夢身上。然後，從自己的牌庫任意選擇1張卡加入手牌。並且重洗牌庫。","ja":"このカードは、前の相手の番に、自分のポケモンがきぜつしていなければ使えない。\n\n自分のトラッシュから基本エネルギーを1枚選び、自分のポケモンにつける。その後、自分の山札から好きなカードを1枚選び、手札に加える。そして山札を切る。"},"legal":{"standard":false,"expanded":false},"versions":[{"finishes":null,"printings":{"zh-tw":{"uuid":"03d42de9-1d6f-5b57-aebb-5763a34b7a06"}}}]},
{"id":"SK-023","uuid":"92a09d60-067a-5506-90e9-108a2164b6db","oracleId":"d3875961-0651-5f19-b444-c061c85f4637","localId":"023","category":"Trainer","name":{"zh-tw":"可爾妮的氣勢","ja":"コルニの気合い"},"illustrator":"kirisAki","regulationMark":"E","trainerType":"Supporter","effect":{"zh-tw":"從牌庫抽卡直到自己的手牌滿6張為止。","ja":"自分の手札が6枚になるように、山札を引く。"},"legal":{"standard":false,"expanded":false},"versions":[{"finishes":null,"printings":{"zh-tw":{"uuid":"b17d16e9-a014-578c-a257-8cf102b48f6b"}}}]},
{"id":"SK-024","uuid":"999906d7-dfc7-5b3a-9e30-3948b4985042","oracleId":"105e3cdd-83b8-5e36-bcee-becf9a1d072e","localId":"024","category":"Trainer","name":{"zh-tw":"博士的研究（山梨博士）","ja":"博士の研究（ナナカマド博士）"},"illustrator":"Sanosuke Sakuma","regulationMark":"F","trainerType":"Supporter","effect":{"zh-tw":"將自己的手牌全部丟棄，從牌庫抽出7張卡。","ja":"自分の手札をすべてトラッシュし、山札を7枚引く。"},"legal":{"standard":false,"expanded":false},"versions":[{"finishes":null,"printings":{"zh-tw":{"uuid":"30115ab9-2b86-5f64-81b8-638862697fb4"}}}]},
